%% title: Card verification · re-verification — Worldpay 3DS
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant GW as API gateway
    box rgb(219,234,254) ★ = built by me
    participant A as api-account ★
    end
    participant R as Redis
    participant W as Worldpay
    participant N as api-notification
    U->>GW: Card verification request
    GW->>A: authorize
    A->>R: Check daily attempt count
    alt over the limit
        A-->>U: Daily limit reached
    else allowed
        A->>R: Increase attempt count
        A->>W: Zero-amount payment · 3DS request
        W-->>A: 3DS step required
        A-->>U: Guide through the 3DS step
        U->>A: 3DS step completed
        A->>W: Final authorisation
        alt 4xx (user-side failure)
            W-->>A: Declined
            A->>A: Store rejection history
            A->>N: Failure notification
            A-->>U: 200 + failure reason code
        else 5xx (vendor failure)
            W-->>A: Failure
            A->>R: Roll back attempt count
            A-->>U: Error · ask to retry
        else approved
            A->>A: Check abnormal-attempt blocking
            A->>A: Store card token · history
            A-->>U: Success
        end
    end
    note over GW,W: Re-verification: same path · no daily limit · result notification
